data/wqb.db.bak*

# One-off cleanup script
cleanup_tmp.py


# pytest cache
.pytest_cache/
# pytest custom temp dir (tests redirect TMPDIR here; runtime artifacts, never commit)
.pytest_tmp/
# agent/IDE state
.qoder/
.vscode/

# attic = 本地归档区（历史备份/旧代码/DB 快照），只留磁盘不进仓库
attic/

# Skills mirror (local sync copy, not project code)
.qoder-cn/

# temp commit-message files (never commit)
logs/_commit_msg.txt
# one-off probe/verify scripts + their output dumps (tmp by convention; archive to attic/ before purge)
logs/_tmp_*
# 同上：MCP 包内一次性探针脚本（wave 检查/指标/字段抓取等，用完即弃）
world-quant-brain-mcp/_tmp_*.py

# SuperAlpha API result dumps (runtime artifacts, never commit)
world-quant-brain-mcp/super_alpha_result_*.json

# Windows reserved device name: some external command redirects logs with `> nul`,
# which silently creates a real file named `nul` in the repo root. It keeps coming
# back (regenerated by a long-running process), so ignore it rather than chase it.
/nul
# pytest temp dir variant
.pytest_tmp_run/
# external agent scratch/state (not project code)
.box-agent/
# local reference material (kept on disk, not part of the repo)
alpha模板.docx
# session planning scratch (planning-with-files 三件套：会话级草稿，不入库)
/findings.md
/progress.md
/task_plan.md

# ===== 备份/冲突残留（2026-09-05 审计新增）=====
# clean_unused_imports.py 异常中断会留下 *.bak_imp；手工日期备份是 *.bak_YYYYMMDD
*.bak_imp
*.bak_20*
*.orig
*.rej
# 待用户确认删除的清理暂存区（device_bash 无删除权限时的落脚点）
_to_delete/

# ===== Skill 运行期产物（2026-09-05 审计新增）=====
# Claude/skills/ 下只入 skill 源（SKILL.md / references / scripts / templates / configs 样例），
# 运行产物一律本地保留：judge 判定快照、GEM 任务目录与 final_expressions、
# 特征工程 ideas 报告、模板处理中间件、ace 调试日志。
Claude/skills/*/outputs/
Claude/skills/*/scripts/outputs/
Claude/skills/*/output_report/
Claude/skills/brain-inspectRawTemplate-create-Setting/processed_templates/
Claude/skills/*/parsetab.py
Claude/skills/**/parsetab.py

# skill 自带的 data/ 是 skill 内容（judge 论坛语料、robustness 事件样例等），
# 不受上面仓库级 `data/` 排除影响 —— 先放开目录再放开内容，否则父目录被排除时无法回收。
!Claude/skills/*/data/
!Claude/skills/*/data/**
# 但 skill data 下的运行期快照仍然排除
Claude/skills/*/data/*/final_expressions.json
